ent-RUMCTransformerDown = step-down transformer
    .desc = Takes the high voltage line and gives the medium voltage one, and after it come the panels and the APCs. Join the high voltage cable to one side and the medium to the other (under it or run by hand).
ent-RUMCTransformerUp = step-up transformer
    .desc = Takes the medium voltage line and gives the high voltage one, to carry the power far, or from a generator of the medium voltage to the grid. Join the medium voltage cable to one side and the high to the other (under it or run by hand).

au14-craft-recipe-buildtransformerdown = Step-down transformer
au14-craft-recipe-buildtransformerup = Step-up transformer
au14-craft-recipe-buildpowerpanel = Electrical panel


ent-RUMCColonyApc = colony APC
    .desc = A steel power cabinet with a door. Shut, it shows its screen; open, it shows the wiring. Feed it the medium voltage and it gives the low one to a cable run by hand and to every device in its reach.

au14-craft-recipe-buildcolonyapc = Colony APC

