au14-service-door-close = Shut the door
au14-service-door-panel-open = The wiring is unscrewed: the door cannot be shut.
au14-service-door-ui-blocked = The door is open: the screen is out of reach. Shut it first.
au14-service-door-wiring-behind = The wiring is behind the door. Open the door first.
